OL,3,GNEWSATwo in hospital after partial
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo workers have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a building site surrounded by
OL,8,Fscaffolding partially collapsed.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fapartment block under construction on
OL,12,Fthe A4260 Cherwell Street in Banbury,
OL,13,FOxfordshire, on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police said nine workers
OL,16,Fwere at the building site when the
OL,17,Fcollapse happened. The Health and
OL,18,FSafety Executive (HSE) said it was
OL,19,Faware of the incident and was making
OL,20,Fenquiries.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
